/-!
# Hurwitz integers

The ring of Hurwitz integers, the maximal order in the rational quaternions
generated by `1, i, j, k` together with `ω := (-1 + i + j + k) / 2`.

## Main definitions

* `Hurwitz`: the ring of Hurwitz integers, defined as a structure with an
  integer basis `1, ω, i, j`.
* `Hurwitz.toQuaternion`: the embedding into the rational quaternions.
-/


